---
args: { evidence: IndexedPortfolioEvidence[], portfolio: PortfolioAssessmentRequest }
returns: PortfolioCompetencyMap[]
---
For each evidence item compare the specific learner behavior with the named competency definition and level. Record the exact source location and the facet demonstrated. Keep mentioned-but-unshown skills in missingFacets. If an approved accommodation changes form, compare the observed behavior against the same competency outcome rather than rejecting the format.
